From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Grische <github@grische.xyz>
Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 13:35:23 +0200
Subject: MIPS: configs: grx500: enable the SSO LED driver

The FRITZ!Box 7590's front panel needs LEDS_LGM, and this defconfig is
where every other feature block on this platform declares itself. As a
module, matching the two LED symbols already here and the reason stated
in OpenWrt's target config: the driver ships as a kmod package, and =y
would leave that package with no object to install.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-fable-5
Signed-off-by: Grische <github@grische.xyz>

diff --git a/arch/mips/configs/grx500_defconfig b/arch/mips/configs/grx500_defconfig
index c619a89c4a0b..fd543dfedcb1 100644
--- a/arch/mips/configs/grx500_defconfig
+++ b/arch/mips/configs/grx500_defconfig
@@ -116,6 +116,7 @@ CONFIG_USB_DWC3_HOST=y
 CONFIG_NEW_LEDS=y
 CONFIG_LEDS_CLASS=y
 CONFIG_LEDS_GPIO=y
+CONFIG_LEDS_LGM=m
 CONFIG_LEDS_TRIGGERS=y
 CONFIG_LEDS_TRIGGER_TIMER=y
 CONFIG_LEDS_TRIGGER_DEFAULT_ON=y
